WEBVTT

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:33.397
what good does it do us to punish those with the proxy?

00:14:33.397 --> 00:14:37.941
Sometimes I think back to that night in the E.R.

00:14:37.941 --> 00:14:40.254
seven years ago.

00:14:40.254 --> 00:14:43.878
I wish I could speak with that woman again.

00:14:43.878 --> 00:14:47.133
I'd like to tell her how sorry I am.

00:14:47.133 --> 00:14:50.020
I'd say, as a doctor, I delivered

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:53.680
the best clinical care I could,

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:57.577
but as a human being,

00:14:57.577 --> 00:14:59.985
I let you down.

00:14:59.985 --> 00:15:04.230
You didn't need my judgment and my contempt.